; Sources: configs/misc/simulation_objects_props.ltx (props), configs/text/eng/st_land_names.xml (real names),
;          S.T.A.L.K.E.R. canon. Mundane wildlife lairs default to their level; generic anomalies are handled
;          at runtime by xsmart.has_anomaly (only the ominously-named anomaly spots are overridden below).

